<p>Hey, sorry if this is a necro-response, but I feel like you deserved an answer.</p>
<p>SCP-845 used to be a door that makes you crazy. It was pretty rightfully downvoted to oblivion, and deleted.</p>
<p>I wrote this tale back before that happened, and a much better 845 has taken the place. I just haven't edited the story at all.</p>
<p>Thanks!</p>

